    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051350/extras/e1427346d67c3a79bbb4584906d7ca55.avif?t=1737966056\" /></div><br><br>Laki knows the fate of the outcasts firsthand: beastmen disappear if they are close to him. To break this curse, Laki travels to the Dead Forest, a place from which almost no one has ever returned. But who will be the key to the secrets of his fate and the mysteries of the forest? A shaman and keeper of destinies, a ghost of the past, or a young magician who lost his way home? And who is the mysterious stranger, Claude, accompanying Laki on his journey?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051350/extras/f3a91d084845fb591bfc30cc76aecc7c.avif?t=1737966056\" /></div>                                                                                                                                <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Find out the past of the forest to reveal its secrets and the reason of its emptiness<br></li><li> Story that may change dramatically with your choices<br></li><li> Four characters to build a romantic relationship with<br></li><li> Beastiary, treasure hunt and secret scenes<br></li><li> Unique soundtrack</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051350/extras/f8dceb2ed763251c3d72076f3e966c43.avif?t=1737966056\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051350/extras/8d07edaab9229bb285742c3ebbc11797.avif?t=1737966056\" /></div><br>A curious lynx who, by the will of fate, is drawn to the Dead Forest. He needs to find a magical spring to get rid of his curse, but more than one obstacle will appear in his way.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051350/extras/9c9435bf97308833960cb5bfad20e3cf.avif?t=1737966056\" /></div><br>A lone spider, Laki's first guide along the gloomy roads of the Dead Forest. He volunteers to help and shows Laki the way, but what is he really after?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051350/extras/a342b91548ea106fa89bcc61ed80fc30.avif?t=1737966056\" /></div><br>A smug and haughty shaman who died in the distant past. Laki is able to overcome the shackles of time, but will he be able to save Ramiro from a death foretold?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051350/extras/0609d173697867b681d5287bd801a688.avif?t=1737966056\" /></div><br>A wayward and clumsy red panda who wants to bring Yong Hen's memories back. What connects him with the cemetery and what are his true intentions?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051350/extras/87b2fafd958c84577bf742c074cc090f.avif?t=1737966056\" /></div><br>A mysterious spirit with no memory of his own past that lives near the cemetery. What secrets does he hide behind the ghostly shell of his curse?",
